  "date": "2025-07-24T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Week 31: Tallinn Summer School\n\nAs I mentioned before, I got a free chance to attend Tallinn Summer School! I chose the class \"Experimental Interaction Design\".\n\nIn this course, I’m working on a wrist-worn hearing aid that notifies the user of emergencies via vibration. 🚨\n\nNext week, I plan to use Edge Impulse to train a model that can detect ambulance sirens — pretty excited to see how it turns out! 😄",
